    <description>Frees a villa the moment its ten minute hold lapses, instead of waiting up to twenty minutes for ADHA_HoldSweeper. Every rule about whether the hold may actually be released lives in the Apex action, which re-reads the row under a lock: Flow cannot lock a row, and without that a customer who accepts the undertaking in the gap would lose a confirmed reservation. The sweeper stays as the backstop, because editing or deactivating this flow discards its pending scheduled paths.</description>
